Z||000002||voyagerspe||05-12-2001||12:51 AM||||oh, Its much to hard a conversion.  Give it up. Ill take your "extra" parts car off your hands.  Those Getrags are junk anyway you dont want it.  <P><BR>Ok, of course im joking.  I havent done a fiero conversion to 5 speed yet.  however ive got the parts and ive been toying with the idea. I did convert a gto once,  with any conversion like this if you have the donor car next to the car the parts are going into its much easier.  Just plan on it taking 3 times as long as you expect it too,  and spending twice as much money as you think it will cost.  If I do do this conversion I would swap All the wiring and every item on the car that is different.  I would want my car to be exactly like it would be if the factory made it that way.<P>that just my 2 cents<BR>||||reg||7
